              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba Deema anyakugonza ensi enu enyakuroho, akandugaho yagenda Teesalonika. Kereseke akagenda Galatiya, Tito yagenda Dalamatiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.10",
