          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kwetonganirra kwange okw'okubanza, busaho n'omu ayansagikire; boona bakandugaho. Hati ninsaba baleke kukijunaanwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu MUKAMA akanyemerraho, yampa amaani ag'okurangirirra kimu ekigambo kye, nukwo Abanyamahanga boona basobole kukihurra. Na nyowe nukwo natabukire nti akanwa k'entale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA alintabura akabi koona kandi alinjuna, antwale omu bukama bwe obw'omwiguru. Ekitiinisa kibe hali Uwe, ebiro n'ebiro. Amiina.",
          "type": "text",
